    "home-film-v2": {
      "title": "A release card drafts itself from the primitives (layout, radius, surface, type, an isometric rocket on its pad, a pull request icon morphing out of its keyline circle, a spring, the accent) and deploys from its action island while an animation of a branch merging runs, its sounds drawn as waveforms. A theme passes through it, and the camera pulls back to the whole system, components, motion, sound and themes, moving and re-theming as one, under the line “Designed as one.”",
