    "loop-themes": {
      "title": "A usage and billing screen takes on Cinnabar in the Brutal style one layer of the theme at a time, each carried by its own line: colour, the chart palette, radius and density, type, stroke and shadow, then the component style. Then Youj, Heather, Seaglass and Cinnabar sit side by side on the one screen, each in a style of its own, while its chart switches to seven days and back, the lower half switches between light and dark to show each palette tuned for the mode, and a last line brings Youj home.",
